{"sections":[{"backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","projectFiles":"OUDS-Onboarding-Tutorial.zip","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","title":"Swift Package integration","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several libraries for your needs."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These libraries help to split products and make users able to select only what they need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"hero","chapter":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its libraries"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"anchor":"Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","stepsSection":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Using Xcode, in your "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"project package dependencies","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", add a new "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"dependency","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Search with the GitHub repository URL (https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios), and select the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"ouds-ios","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" dependency.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can then choose the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"dependency rule","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" you want.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To know which version you need, you can have a look on the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and also the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/releases","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-onboarding-1-ouds-swift-package.png","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s say you will use the some beta version, here 3.0.0-beta.8"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"type":"step"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add for example only the umbrella product merging all products mentioned above: ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"text"}]}]}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you downloaded the package, you will see several libraries are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They can be embedded inside your "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"target","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" libraries."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Things are separated to let users integrate only what they need and embed the bare minimum of content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesContract","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" library provides the main elements like the "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The theme contract is defined inside it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesOrange","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesSosh"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Sosh products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesWireframe"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Wireframe theme, which is a theme dedicated to mockups and prototypes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesOrangeCompact","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products but with constraints of sizes and spaces.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSComponents","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" contains the SwiftUI OUDS components defined with the Figma specifications, and also useful view modifers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSTokensRaw","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensSemantic"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSTokensComponents","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" are libraries defining and providing the tokens for low level (raw),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle level (semantic) or component levels (high level).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSModules"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is for modules or rich components with extra logic.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSFoundations"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is dedicated to some utilities and shared logic."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-onboarding-1-ouds-libraries.png"}],"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS for iOS is an open source Swift Package available on GitHub under MIT license."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The package and the libraries must be added through Xcode."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"mediaPosition":"trailing"}]}]},{"assessments":[{"type":"multiple-choice","title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which of these choices is correct?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"choices":[{"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, under MIT license, and hosted on GitHub. Of course you can contribute!"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"I can contribute to OUDS using pull request"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":true},{"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The main supported targets are iOS \/ iPadOS. However we do our best to support macOS, visionOS, tvOS and watchOS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CarPlay specific cases are not scoped yet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS supports officialy all Apple OS like visionOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, iOS and also CarPlay."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS provides UIKit components","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS supports only SwiftUI.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"content":[]},{"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which imports of the OUDS Swift Package products can I choose?"}]}],"choices":[{"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can import all products provided by the Swift Package, and tailor your choice to keep only the ones needed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Even if we recommend to choose only the atomic products you need, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" product wraps all of them.","type":"text"}]}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Some of the available products depending to my needs, or only ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if I am very lazy and don’t care about my app size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":true},{"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You need to chose the products the Swift package provides."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"None, only the Swift package dependency matter.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false}],"content":[],"type":"multiple-choice"}],"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessments"},{"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","abstract":[{"text":"Let’s suppose we want to define a view for corporate apps with headings, texts, buttons and images.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"How can we do that?","type":"text"}],"action":{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view","overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Get started","type":"text"}]},"title":"Define information cards","kind":"callToAction"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-libraries"]],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-libraries","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Check-Your-Understanding"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-